{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/extras/fdd0941635d9c7c641bec8993449be9e.avif?t=1762002014\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend car meets. Lay down wagers. Chat with the characters making up the local street racing scene. Respect is earned around here. Treat people right and get them to join your crew. Don't fancy making friends? Make rivals instead. <strong>Know the right people to get to know other people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/extras/904bb7419d6c432bcbf8754ae48ada72.avif?t=1762002014\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/extras/28322ca01538e4def0999f3a085ce218.avif?t=1762002014\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Car Roster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of  tuners, supercars and oddballs, inspired by iconic designs from past decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ride with <strong>body kits, spoilers, rims, fitment options, or even change its</strong> <strong>livery</strong>. Upgrade its performance to keep up with the pack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/extras/23c043bf740c4e078668312d55fec512.avif?t=1762002014\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Flies By</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race and interaction makes the time pass by. Choose your events wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Sick Standings changing every night, <strong>do you risk losing positions by taking the day off, or do you continue the grind to get to the top?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play the game at your own pace instead? Disable the night system entirely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/extras/51f1bc95e04ee054cd591c0d7492678f.avif?t=1762002014\" alt=\"\"width=1170 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sick City Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted and stylized world. Race downtown as towering buildings pass by. Take shortcuts through tight alleyways. Slow things down by driving through the mountain roads, death drops lurking at every turn. Dash through the industrial area, complete with a dockyard just waiting for some gymkhana style drifting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128920?t=1762002014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/95108760f97edcdcc2da882d2686e54f6a8a52f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762002014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/4c5af912150064bacd80d2388a489c5d29b3973b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762002014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128920/4c5af912150064bacd80d2388a489c5d29b3973b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762002014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_